Cell["\<\
The horizon (b) has to be shifted by the energy computed in the masterscalar \
notebook. also, the 20 squared factor comes from the normalization factor \
used some paragraphs down.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.930306368289226*^9, 3.93030644639041*^9}, {
  3.954580334252767*^9, 
